From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 02:47:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_ui: choreograph message lifecycle, tool-call cascade,
 checkmark pop, smooth auto-scroll

Entry containers fade-rise 8px/150ms on first render (new entries only);
trailing tool-call runs stagger 40ms apart capped at 5; status icons
cross-fade 120ms; plan checkmarks scale-pop 200ms; ListState gains an
opt-in follow-snap throttle (<=1 correction/100ms while streaming).
All gated on agent.animations (full/reduced/off).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GPuXXV8jUXtMtvCyG4Lbub
